# File ket qua xuat ra — la DU LIEU HOC SINH, khong bao gio duoc vao git.
# Ten mac dinh cua export_csv la ket_qua_phan_bo.csv, kem thu muc
# ket_qua_phan_bo_theo_club/. Chan rong de bat ca cac ten khac.
match_results.csv
ket_qua*.csv
ket_qua*_theo_club/

# NGOAI LE: ket_qua_thu_tai.csv la SO DO THU TAI, khong phai du lieu hoc
# sinh. Ca 18 cot deu la so dem va thoi gian (so hoc sinh, so CLB, giay,
# MB); cot chu duy nhat chi nhan hai gia tri "chia_deu"/"theo_nhu_cau".
# Day la du lieu THO dung sau bao cao thu tai — thieu no thi
# bao_cao_thu_tai.html khong ai dung lai duoc, ma README lai dang tro
# toi. Luat ket_qua*.csv o tren chan nham no chi vi trung tien to ten.
!du_lieu_test/thu_tai/ket_qua_thu_tai.csv
# PHAN HOI KHAO SAT — DU LIEU HOC SINH CO THAT, khac han moi bo du lieu
# trong du_lieu_test/ (deu la may sinh). Day la cau tra loi cua hoc sinh
# that, phan lon la tre vi thanh nien. Khong bao gio duoc vao git.
#
# Chan theo DUOI BANG TINH chu khong theo ten, vi Google Forms dat ten
# mac dinh khac nhau tuy ngon ngu: "... (Responses)" hoac "... (Phan hoi)".
# Chi bang tinh moi bi chan, nen ban thân BO CAU HOI (KHAO_SAT_CAU_HOI.md)
# van vao git binh thuong — do la cong cu do, khong phai du lieu.
*(Responses)*.csv
*(Responses)*.xlsx
*Responses*.csv
*Responses*.xlsx
*hản hồi*.csv
*hản hồi*.xlsx
phan_hoi*.csv
phan_hoi*.xlsx
khao_sat*.csv
khao_sat*.xlsx
KHAO_SAT*.csv
KHAO_SAT*.xlsx

build/
dist/
